 ## [Unreleased]
+### Changed
+ - The default components to constrain in `Dirichlet` and `PeriodicDirichlet` have changed
+   from component 1 to all components of the field. For scalar problems this has no effect.
+   ([#506][github-506], [#509][github-509])
 
